                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ba74fe5b-6fbb-3aa0-a148-875e0e012144",
                        "entry_id": "85ffe36a-07af-3ef3-9207-3963776e0663",
                        "glosses": [
                            "специалист в области визажа, то есть создания образа с помощью макияжа, причёски и т. п."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f4311c77-2829-408f-9321-82bb680be635",
                                "sense_id": "ba74fe5b-6fbb-3aa0-a148-875e0e012144",
                                "text": "Непосредственно макияж имеет свои направления — подиумный, креативный, боди-арт, коммерческий (салонный), телевизионный, сценический (театр и кино)."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "454692e4-bd53-4fde-9f14-faabc5c00dd2",
                        "source_entry_id": "85ffe36a-07af-3ef3-9207-3963776e0663",
                        "source_sense_id": "ba74fe5b-6fbb-3aa0-a148-875e0e012144",
                        "target_lang_word": "esthetician",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "esthetician",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "42768723-3234-38d6-8d60-84298d432239",
                                        "entry_id": "40c54d66-c107-3f25-90d4-3a001f2e0e00",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative form of aesthetician."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative",
                                            "uncommon"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2de6bc4-0aa6-4b39-a1d6-c345afe8168e",
                                                "sense_id": "42768723-3234-38d6-8d60-84298d432239",
                                                "text": "Skin-care specialists call themselves estheticians, she informed me: \"The esthetician is more than a cosmetician, who just applies cosmetics to the outside; an esthetician knows your body inside out, using everything from massage to vitamins in caring for your skin.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca6445f3-c70a-4c11-838e-a30ce5e63aef",
                                                "sense_id": "42768723-3234-38d6-8d60-84298d432239",
                                                "text": "Though estheticians can perform laser hair removal, it's safest to go to a dermatologist—no matter the color of your skin."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be770ed8-a1c5-4b61-a129-4d3449a6d645",
                                                "sense_id": "42768723-3234-38d6-8d60-84298d432239",
                                                "text": "According to dermatologists and estheticians, you can expect to see a noticeable difference around the age of 40 — which is why I consulted five of these skin experts who are 40+ themselves, getting their top tips for transitioning (and maintaining) an effective skin care regimen."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
